# Optional: the dashboard works in a clearly labelled demo mode without keys.
# For local Vinext/Wrangler development copy these names to an ignored .dev.vars
# file. For a hosted Site, add them through its environment settings instead.
# Keep real keys private; never add them to browser code or Git.

# https://www.alphavantage.co/support/#api-key
# One uncached company lookup makes up to six provider requests; subsequent
# lookups are cached for ten minutes in the current server instance.
# Search makes one request, cached for one hour. Limits and market coverage
# depend on your provider plan. Some endpoints may require paid access.
# Quotes are latest available provider quotes, potentially delayed/end-of-day.
ALPHA_VANTAGE_API_KEY=

# Optional AI explanations of real provider news. This can incur usage costs.
# https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/api-key
# Fictional demo headlines always use a written sample, even with an AI key.
GEMINI_API_KEY=
GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-2.5-flash

# Server-controlled bootstrap administrators. Exact verified sign-in emails or IDs.
# Hosted values belong in Sites runtime secrets. Never use a browser role toggle.
STOCKWISE_ADMIN_EMAILS=
STOCKWISE_ADMIN_USER_IDS=

# Cloudflare DB (D1) and BUCKET (R2) are runtime bindings declared in
# .openai/hosting.json, not API keys or values to copy into this file.
